    "custom_liquid_J3jp6c": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "Custom Liquid",
      "settings": {
        "full_width": true,
        "remove_vertical_spacing": true,
        "remove_horizontal_spacing": true,
        "liquid": "{% comment %} AURALIS — Comment l'utiliser (toujours ouvert + zoom hover) {% endcomment %}\n\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n<style>\n  .aur-use {\n    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;\n    color: #1A1A1A;\n    max-width: 640px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 40px 20px 48px;\n  }\n\n  .aur-use__eyebrow {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 12px;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n  }\n  .aur-use__eyebrow-line {\n    height: 1px; width: 36px;\n    background: rgba(198,139,61,0.4);\n  }\n  .aur-use__eyebrow-text {\n    font-size: 10.5px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 0.24em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: #C68B3D;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .aur-use__title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: clamp(28px, 6vw, 42px);\n    font-weight: 300;\n    font-style: italic;\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n    margin: 0 0 6px;\n    color: #1A1A1A;\n  }\n  .aur-use__divider {\n    width: 44px; height: 2px;\n    background: #C68B3D;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n    margin: 0 auto 32px;\n  }\n\n  .aur-use__steps {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 12px;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n  }\n\n  .aur-use__card {\n    background: #FBF3E6;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(198,139,61,0.35);\n    border-radius: 18px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(198,139,61,0.15);\n    transition: transform 0.22s ease, box-shadow 0.22s ease;\n  }\n  .aur-use__card:hover {\n    transform: scale(1.025);\n    box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(198,139,61,0.22);\n  }\n  .aur-use__card:active {\n    transform: scale(1.015);\n  }\n\n  .aur-use__card-head {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 16px;\n    padding: 18px 20px;\n    user-select: none;\n  }\n  .aur-use__num {\n    width: 42px; height: 42px; min-width: 42px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #5C3A21;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n  .aur-use__card-info { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }\n  .aur-use__card-label {\n    font-size: 9.5px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 0.22em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: #C68B3D;\n    margin: 0 0 2px;\n  }\n  .aur-use__card-title {\n    font-size: 17px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #1A1A1A;\n    margin: 0;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n  }\n\n  .aur-use__card-body {\n    border-top: 1px solid rgba(198,139,61,0.10);\n  }\n  .aur-use__card-body-inner {\n    padding: 14px 20px 20px 78px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.65;\n    color: #5A554E;\n  }\n  .aur-use__card-body-inner strong {\n    color: #1A1A1A;\n    font-weight: 600;\n  }\n\n  .aur-use__conseil {\n    background: #5C3A21;\n    border-radius: 18px;\n    padding: 20px 22px;\n  }\n  .aur-use__conseil-header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n  }\n  .aur-use__conseil-icon {\n    width: 32px; height: 32px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.20);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n  .aur-use__conseil-icon svg {\n    width: 16px; height: 16px;\n    stroke: #FFFFFF; fill: none;\n    stroke-width: 2; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round;\n  }\n  .aur-use__conseil-label {\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 0.24em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.80);\n  }\n  .aur-use__conseil-text {\n    font-size: 14.5px;\n    font-style: italic;\n    line-height: 1.65;\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .aur-use__conseil-text strong {\n    font-style: normal;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  .aur-use__mention {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #8A8178;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    margin-top: 20px;\n    padding: 0 8px;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 480px) {\n    .aur-use__card:hover { transform: none; }\n    .aur-use__card:active { transform: none; }\n    .aur-use__card-head { padding: 16px; gap: 12px; }\n    .aur-use__card-title { font-size: 16px; }\n    .aur-use__card-body-inner { padding-left: 16px; font-size: 13px; }\n    .aur-use__conseil { padding: 18px; }\n    .aur-use__conseil-text { font-size: 13.5px; }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"aur-use\">\n\n  <div class=\"aur-use__eyebrow\">\n    <span class=\"aur-use__eyebrow-line\"></span>\n    <span class=\"aur-use__eyebrow-text\">Mode d'emploi</span>\n    <span class=\"aur-use__eyebrow-line\"></span>\n  </div>\n  <h2 class=\"aur-use__title\">Comment l'utiliser</h2>\n  <div class=\"aur-use__divider\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"aur-use__steps\">\n\n    <div class=\"aur-use__card\">\n      <div class=\"aur-use__card-head\">\n        <span class=\"aur-use__num\">1</span>\n        <div class=\"aur-use__card-info\">\n          <p class=\"aur-use__card-label\">Étape 1</p>\n          <h3 class=\"aur-use__card-title\">Glisser</h3>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"aur-use__card-body\">\n        <div class=\"aur-use__card-body-inner\">\n          Placez votre <strong>pain frais</strong> directement dans le sac en cire d'abeille Auralis, juste après l'achat ou la cuisson.\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"aur-use__card\">\n      <div class=\"aur-use__card-head\">\n        <span class=\"aur-use__num\">2</span>\n        <div class=\"aur-use__card-info\">\n          <p class=\"aur-use__card-label\">Étape 2</p>\n          <h3 class=\"aur-use__card-title\">Refermer</h3>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"aur-use__card-body\">\n        <div class=\"aur-use__card-body-inner\">\n          Repliez le haut du sac ou nouez le lien pour <strong>bien envelopper le pain</strong>. La cire d'abeille se moule à la forme du pain grâce à la chaleur de vos mains.\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"aur-use__card\">\n      <div class=\"aur-use__card-head\">\n        <span class=\"aur-use__num\">3</span>\n        <div class=\"aur-use__card-info\">\n          <p class=\"aur-use__card-label\">Étape 3</p>\n          <h3 class=\"aur-use__card-title\">Conserver</h3>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"aur-use__card-body\">\n        <div class=\"aur-use__card-body-inner\">\n          Rangez-le à température ambiante, à l'abri de la lumière directe. <strong>Le pain respire</strong> — mie moelleuse et croûte croustillante préservées plus longtemps.\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"aur-use__conseil\">\n    <div class=\"aur-use__conseil-header\">\n      <span class=\"aur-use__conseil-icon\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"12\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"12.01\" y2=\"16\"/></svg>\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"aur-use__conseil-label\">Conseil Auralis</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"aur-use__conseil-text\">\n      Pour prolonger sa durée de vie, lavez le sac <strong>à l'eau froide avec un savon doux</strong>, puis laissez-le sécher à l'air libre.\n      Évitez l'eau chaude, le lave-vaisselle et le micro-ondes, qui feraient fondre la cire.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <p class=\"aur-use__mention\">\n    Ne pas utiliser pour la viande crue ou le poisson · Éviter tout contact prolongé avec une source de chaleur · Tenir hors de portée des enfants\n  </p>\n\n</div>",
